      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        331.5796203613281,
        527.392578125,
        346.02264404296875
      ],
      "text": "about the risk of incorporation bias when using a composite reference standard in this group, thus",
