      "size": 10.95586109161377,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        357.9796142578125,
        527.403564453125,
        372.4226379394531
      ],
      "text": "risk of false-positive diagnoses in children following a false-positive screening test compared with",
