      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        397.5796203613281,
        527.4059448242188,
        412.02264404296875
      ],
      "text": "results of the screening test or tests. When screening high-risk groups of children, including close",
